        <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The Contracting Authority proposes to engage in competitive process for the establishment of a framework agreement for the Supply, Installation, Commissioning, and Maintenance of a Horizontal Tensile Test System Atlantic Technological University (ATU), Galway City Campus. The initial contract is for the supply and installation of the Horizontal Tensile Test System. The Tensile Test System/Bed is required to test a range of medical devices and associated components under highly controlled parameters at a test speed of at least 0.0005-3000mm/min. The Tensile Test System must have a capacity to transmit measurements at a minimum rate of 2,000Hza including a video capturing multi camera system.</cbc:Description>
